It is the programming language of the web.
It is used to create client-side dynamic pages.
It can update and change both HTML and CSS.
It can calculate, manipulate and validate data.
It is a programming language that lets developers create interactive web pages.
An interactive web page is a dynamic webpage that responds to user actions in real-time.
Unlike static webpage like HTML that only display fixed content, interactive pages allow users to 
⚪ Respond to User Input
Buttons, forms, clicks, hovers, scrolls, or keystrokes trigger immediate feedback.
Example:- A "Like" button that changes color when clicked.
⚪ Update Content Without Reloading
Uses AJAX or Fetch API to load new data dynamically.
